WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.630
Steal the God Card

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.140
Something's wrong with Mai.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:36.440
Mai!  Pull yourself together!

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.650
Mai!  Hang in there!

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:42.300
I hear someone.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:45.150
But who are you?

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:46.880
Mai?

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:52.960
Mai, are you hallucinating?

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:58.200
You don't know how flustered she feels.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:02.700
I'll use this Shadow Game to plunge her into loneliness!

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.240
My turn.

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:06.480
I set a card.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:10.460
Then I summon Makyura the Destructor in attack position!

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:19.520
I equip Makyura with the spell card Black Pendant!

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:29.490
My monster gains 500 attack points.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:35.560
Marik's monster is now stronger than mine.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:36.730
He's going to attack!

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:41.440
A Shadow Game is a world of illusion and enchantment.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.530
Only the chosen ones can see its effects.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.250
Mai Kujaku, enjoy the shadow world!

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.240
Makyura the Destructor attacks!

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:55.040
I flip over my trap card!

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.980
Amazoness Archers!

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:08.320
This trap stops your monster's attack and reduces its attack points by 500!

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:12.740
You're tough.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:15.470
The Unfriendly Amazon's counterattack!

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.400
Betrayal Dance!

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:27.320
Oh, it's you.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:29.670
What's wrong?

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.420
Someone just...

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:34.850
Yes.  Someone vanished from my memories.

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:37.300
I wonder who it was.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:41.300
Not that I care.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:44.940
I like the shadows, but I also love solitude.

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:46.670
This guy...

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:55.920
Black Pendant deals 500 points of damage when the equipped monster is destroyed.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:03.540
I'd love to end my turn, but Makyura the Destructor has an effect.

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:09.590
When it's destroyed, I can activate a trap card from my hand.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.460
I activate this trap card from my hand.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.100
Rope of Life!

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:27.730
This card can only be used on the monster that was destroyed this turn.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:32.750
It resurrects with 800 extra attack points, and it can attack again.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.500
What?

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.800
Go, Makyura the Destructor!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.240
Judgment Blade!

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:50.330
A traitor must be destroyed for killing her own teammate.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.340
Jonouchi!

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:01.240
Ooh, you drew a good card.

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.360
He's your special friend.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.330
I'll lose my memories of Jonouchi.

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.000
I'll lose...

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:23.460
When I was young, my parents died in an accident.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:26.760
I had no relatives, so I survived alone.

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:38.110
I didn't need compassion.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:43.380
There are some things that I can never get, no matter how much I want it.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:47.560
I learned that from an early age.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:51.030
Then I met Harpie Lady.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:57.800
Harpie isn't that strong, but armor and weapons power her up.

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.170
That's how I'll live.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:02.760
That's how my heart cries out.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:07.920
But I hid those feelings in my heart and lived alone.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:12.670
That's when they showed up.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.000
After meeting them...  After meeting Jonouchi...

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.690
I wanted to trust people for the first time.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.900
I'm not alone.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:27.500
I have friends that I can trust.

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:32.570
But all those memories will vanish.

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:35.710
I'll be alone again.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.160
That's right.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.740
You won't remember anything.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:44.710
You'll wander alone into the shadows of death.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.450
Vanish!

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.130
Mai!  What's wrong?

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:01.420
Mai...

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:04.870
Yugi!  What's going on with Mai?

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:09.900
Marik is erasing her memories of her friends.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:11.580
No way!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.960
Can you hear me, Mai?

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:17.300
Mai!  Did you forget about me?

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:28.940
Once a Shadow Game begins, can it be stopped?

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.210
Mai!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.260
Yugi?

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:06.140
Yugi!  How dare you!

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:09.270
Mai!  Don't be tricked by Marik's illusions!

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:10.500
Illusions?

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:14.440
My loneliness and fear are illusions?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:19.610
Yes.  In a Shadow Game, the one who breaks emotionally is the loser.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:24.000
Your fear is creating the illusions.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:25.610
Yugi!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:31.000
I've lost something important.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:36.060
Something that supported me.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:37.630
Mai!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:39.460
Mai, don't lose heart!

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:40.400
That voice...

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:43.420
I don't know who it is, but it touches my heart.

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:44.630
It's warm.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:46.640
Mai, win!

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:49.640
If you win this Shadow Game, Marik's illusions will vanish.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:53.000
Always have light in your heart!

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.420
Regain your lost memories!

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:57.070
Yugi...

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:06.970
Mai, the rest is up to you.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.590
Yugi...

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.470
Mai, hang in there!

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:12.600
We're with you!

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:14.200
I can hear him again.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:18.100
The special voice that supports me...

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:23.440
Yugi used the Millennium Puzzle to intrude in my Shadow Game.

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:27.940
Her memories weren't completely erased yet.

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:32.450
I'm surprised she recovered emotionally from her horrid situation.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.450
Thank you, Yugi.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:35.800
I'm fine now.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:39.020
My fighting spirit won't break so easily.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:43.460
I'll regain what I lost in this duel!

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.700
Only if you win.

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:48.200
My turn!

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:52.470
I won't let you break into my heart again!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.760
Amazoness Chain Master in attack position!

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:02.300
I set a card and end my turn!

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:08.700
Makyura the Destructor has enough attack points to destroy my Amazoness Chain Master.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:14.260
That means he'll attack without worrying about my set card.

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:16.990
My turn.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:21.380
But my set card isn't the trap.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.500
It's Amazoness Chain Master's effect.

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:29.460
When Amazoness Chain Master goes to the graveyard in attack position...

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:32.510
...its Near-Death Chain Dance effect activates.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:40.520
I can pay 1000 life points to take a monster card from his deck.

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:45.250
Feel the fear of loneliness over and over.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:46.490
Here he comes!

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:48.490
My card is...

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:50.510
Holding Arms!

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:57.500
It attacks Amazoness Chain Master!

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.880
500 attack points?

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.510
He's really attacking with that monster?

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:12.510
Holding Arms has captured Amazoness!

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:16.750
It has fewer attack points, so why wasn't it destroyed?

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:20.760
That monster has a secret effect.

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:26.760
Due to its invincible effect, you can't attack it for three turns.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:31.770
Holding Arms doesn't have enough attack points to destroy Amazoness.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:33.030
But...

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:39.460
It can stop her from moving.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:42.460
I'll destroy her within three turns.

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:46.250
I wonder whose memories you'll lose?

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:47.680
Marik...

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.250
Don't lose your cool, Mai.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:55.570
Or Marik's dark powers will overwhelm you again.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.930
Marik!  Stop this pointless fight!

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:04.040
No one can stop this game.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:10.940
When I win, her spirit will be destroyed, and she'll fall into a deep sleep.

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:16.440
It's not pointless to torment your friends.

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:17.780
How dare you!

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.460
Good, Yugi.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.360
Get more angry.

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:28.290
So angry that when we battle, your hate equals what I've built up over the years!

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:31.000
I'll never forgive you, Marik!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:32.200
Yugi!

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.600
Yugi, this is my fight!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.300
Don't interfere!

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.600
I'm a duelist.

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:42.900
I will fight to the end.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.100
Yugi!

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:47.410
Why would Mai fall into a deep sleep?

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.910
That's why it's a Shadow Game.

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:53.130
Shadow Game?

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:56.280
I flip over my set card!

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:59.420
The spell card Grave Arm!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:07.080
This spell buries one monster into the graveyard.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:13.080
Too bad.  My Holding Arms is invincible.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.170
Your effect won't activate.

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:18.480
I never said I'm targeting your monster.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.670
I'm burying...

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:21.410
Can't be.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:23.910
Amazoness Chain Master!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:29.150
If you're not the one destroying it, my memories won't be erased!

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:32.890
Ooh.  You're destroying your own monster.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:37.710
Amazoness Chain Master has an effect!

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.510
Near-Death Chain Dance!

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:45.370
I pay 1000 life points to take one monster from your deck!

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:46.600
What?

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.100
And I'm taking...

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.680
The God Card, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.510
Yeah!

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:55.610
Nice, Mai!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.680
I took your God Card!  The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:34.030
You won't get away with this.

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:37.180
You will die in agony.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.440
You're funny.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.190
But you'll dance in hell before then!

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:45.100
Yeah!  You're awesome, Mai!

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:49.690
She was planning to take Marik's God Card from his deck from the start!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.660
Well done, Mai.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:55.760
Since you took his God Card, Marik's power is greatly reduced.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:15:02.120
But can you control a God Card?

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:04.680
She has the God now.

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:08.780
Big brother, we no longer know who's going to win.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:15.720
He said that only those connected to the Millennium Items can use a God Card.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:20.320
The key is whether a God would obey her or not.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.000
My turn!

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:27.100
I need to tribute three monsters to summon a God.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:32.340
There are two monsters on Marik's field and none on mine.

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:39.600
I'll have to dodge his attacks until I get three monsters on my field.

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.120
Let's see what you can do.

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:43.560
Go, Mai!

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:45.850
If you summon a God, you'll win!

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:48.700
Stay calm, Mai.

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.590
Show me the God, Mai Kujaku.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.600
I set two cards!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:59.280
I summon Amazoness Fighter in attack position!

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.100
I end my turn!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.440
Go ahead and attack me.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.610
I have a trap ready!

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.610
My turn.  I draw!

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:14.710
Marik only has one card in his hand.

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:16.120
This is your chance, Mai.

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:20.620
Makyura the Destructor attacks Amazoness Fighter!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:22.860
Go, Makyura!

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:25.020
I trapped you!

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.860
I activate the spell card Amazoness Spellcaster!

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:36.420
It switches your monster's attack points with mine!

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:43.480
Amazoness Fighter, strike Makyura!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.620
Pandora.  Vanish already.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:56.360
Makyura the Destructor is destroyed!

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:58.080
Nice!

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.630
Marik's almost out of life points!

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:04.130
This feels good.

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:07.370
It feels good to catch my enemy in a trap!

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:09.290
A trap?

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:10.250
Yes.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:12.590
The trap card Card of Last Will!

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:14.870
Card of Last Will?

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:16.020
Yes.

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:22.380
When my monster loses attack points, I can draw until I have five cards in my hand.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:26.390
Marik is replenishing his hand.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:33.240
Next is Makyura the Destructor's effect.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:37.630
When Makyura is destroyed, I can activate a trap card in my hand.

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:42.130
Oh no!  I assumed he'd have no cards in his hand!

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:46.040
Suffer more pain.

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:49.820
I activate the trap card Nightmare Wheel!

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:54.550
Seize Amazoness Fighter!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:18:01.550
Nightmare Wheel takes 500 life points from you every turn.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.560
Thank you for trapping me.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:06.980
What?

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:09.980
I'll return the favor with another trap!

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.920
I activate my trap!

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:12.970
Dramatic Rescue!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:21.210
I return the monster caught in your trap to my hand and summon a different monster in its place.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.210
Is she using that card to...

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:26.550
You're summoning The Winged Dragon of Ra?

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:27.500
No.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:35.220
The Winged Dragon of Ra's attack points are equal to the sum of the three tributed monsters.

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:40.800
If I summon Ra with this card, it'll have 0 attack points.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.330
You're smart.

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:47.230
But there's another way to summon the God Card.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:50.470
How will Mai get three monsters?

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:55.970
I free Amazoness Fighter from Nightmare Wheel and return her to my hand!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:08.720
I'll use Dramatic Rescue to summon this monster!

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:13.970
Cyber Harpie!

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:18.000
That's her go-to monster!

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.000
It's my turn.

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:24.350
Please let me draw the God...

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:32.650
The spell card Graceful Charity!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:36.410
I draw three cards from my deck and discard two.

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:48.250
I'm all set.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:52.570
I'll show you that I can control a God!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.070
Finally!  The God!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:59.070
I see!  Mai's combo is...

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:02.070
God is on my side!

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:04.280
This is my trump card!

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:09.300
I activate the spell card Elegant Egotist!

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:26.260
Harpie Lady Sisters!

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:29.330
So that was her plan!  Awesome, Mai!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:34.910
I tribute three Harpies to summon The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.620
Come, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:05.440
You think you can control a God?

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:10.940
You haven't realized that God is already controlling you!

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.950
That's The Winged Dragon of Ra?

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.290
What?

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.170
What's going on?

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:28.790
Impossible!

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:44.440
A giant sphere appeared in the Duel Ring.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:46.580
Is that really Ra?

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:51.920
Mysterious ancient text appeared on the card in Mai's Duel Disk.

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:55.820
She can't control Ra unless she can decipher the text?

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.960
Marik chants the text, as if conjuring a spell.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:01.600
Ra switches control to Marik!

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:04.560
The sphere is changing shape!

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:07.680
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Mystery of the Hieratic Text

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:09.400
Duel, standby!

00:22:12.590 --> 00:22:20.490
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:20.490 --> 00:22:29.430
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:29.760 --> 00:22:34.400
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:34.400 --> 00:22:38.370
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:46.340
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:49.910
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:54.680
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:54.680 --> 00:23:04.790
And walk it without stopping

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:12.400
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:12.630 --> 00:23:21.370
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:29.350
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:29.350 --> 00:23:39.190
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
